msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:145
#: 4b03368708934d42bb2b4bd9efd41a6d
msgid "Groups of outputs sharing a common timer, MUST have the same advanced configuration. Usually, these are specified in the autopilot's hardware description linked from the :ref:`common-autopilots` page. For example, if an output is configured for DShot in a group, then you cannot use another output in that group for Normal PWM ESC **or** normal PWM servo operation."
msgstr ""

